# ================================================================
# MACHINE LEARNING / TRAINING
# ================================================================
# TensorBoard logs
runs/
logs/
tensorboard/
lightning_logs/

# Weights & Biases
wandb/

# MLflow
mlruns/

# Training outputs
output/
outputs/
checkpoints/
*.log
*.csv
results/
experiments/

# Exception: research_infra/ CSVs are small, hand-curated experiment result
# tables (metrics summaries, comparison tables) that back the phase reports -
# not machine-noise per-batch diagnostic dumps (those live outside the repo,
# under the Google-Drive-style OUTPUT_DIR, and stay ignored).
!research_infra/**/*.csv

